{"title":"Career Roadmap — MRO Planning Engineer","role":"MRO Planning Engineer","summary":"An MRO Planning Engineer plans, schedules, coordinates, and monitors aircraft maintenance activities to ensure aircraft are maintained safely, efficiently, and in compliance with approved maintenance programs and aviation regulations.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Aircraft Maintenance Engineering (AME – DGCA)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An MRO Planning Engineer plans, schedules, coordinates, and monitors aircraft maintenance activities to ensure aircraft are maintained safely, efficiently, and in compliance with approved maintenance programs and aviation regulations."},{"type":"p","text":"MRO = Maintenance, Repair & Overhaul."},{"type":"p","text":"The role connects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft maintenance"},{"text":"Engineering"},{"text":"Maintenance programs"},{"text":"Parts and tooling"},{"text":"Manpower planning"},{"text":"Hangar capacity"},{"text":"Aircraft availability"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"},{"text":"Maintenance data and analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical employers include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airlines"},{"text":"Aircraft MRO organizations"},{"text":"Airport maintenance organizations"},{"text":"Aircraft manufacturers"},{"text":"Component MRO companies"},{"text":"Aviation engineering service providers"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"AME is a regulated aviation pathway. A student should distinguish between an AME licence/approved training route and an engineering degree. Eligibility, approved training, examinations, experience, and licence requirements should be verified against the latest DGCA requirements."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Maintenance Planning Trainee, MRO Planning Engineer"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Maintenance Planning Engineer, Senior Planning Engineer"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Maintenance Planning Lead, Maintenance Control / Planning Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"MRO Planning Manager, Maintenance Program Manager, Head of Planning"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the Degree","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Engineering & Aviation Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mathematics"},{"text":"Physics"},{"text":"Engineering mechanics"},{"text":"Basic electrical/electronics"},{"text":"Engineering drawing"},{"text":"Computer fundamentals"},{"text":"Introduction to aviation"},{"text":"Aircraft terminology"},{"text":"Aviation safety"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong technical English because aviation documentation is highly standardized."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Aircraft & Maintenance Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft structures"},{"text":"Aerodynamics"},{"text":"Aircraft systems"},{"text":"Aircraft engines"},{"text":"Avionics"},{"text":"Aircraft materials"},{"text":"Maintenance practices"},{"text":"Aircraft documentation"},{"text":"Reliability fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the relationship between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aircraft System","Maintenance Requirement","Task","Manpower + Tools + Parts","Aircraft Downtime","Return to Service"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — MRO Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus heavily on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maintenance planning"},{"text":"Maintenance programs"},{"text":"Scheduled maintenance"},{"text":"Unscheduled maintenance"},{"text":"Aircraft utilization"},{"text":"Maintenance forecasting"},{"text":"Hangar planning"},{"text":"Manpower planning"},{"text":"Parts planning"},{"text":"Tool planning"},{"text":"Maintenance scheduling"},{"text":"Aircraft downtime"},{"text":"Maintenance forecasting"},{"text":"Work-package planning"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how maintenance events are planned around aircraft operational schedules."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Industry & Digital MRO"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MRO software knowledge"},{"text":"Maintenance data analytics"},{"text":"Reliability analysis"},{"text":"KPI dashboards"},{"text":"Planning optimization"},{"text":"Supply-chain coordination"},{"text":"Cost estimation"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Regulatory documentation"},{"text":"Internship experience"}]}]},{"heading":"Core Aviation Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong MRO Planning Engineer should understand the major aircraft domains."},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Knowledge"],"rows":[[{"text":"Aircraft Structures"},{"text":"Fuselage, wings, control surfaces"}],[{"text":"Aerodynamics"},{"text":"Lift, drag, stability"}],[{"text":"Propulsion"},{"text":"Turbofan/turboprop fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Avionics"},{"text":"Navigation, communication, flight systems"}],[{"text":"Electrical"},{"text":"Aircraft power systems"}],[{"text":"Hydraulics"},{"text":"Flight controls, landing gear, brakes"}],[{"text":"Pneumatics"},{"text":"Air systems"}],[{"text":"Fuel Systems"},{"text":"Storage, distribution, monitoring"}],[{"text":"Landing Gear"},{"text":"Retraction, braking, steering"}],[{"text":"Flight Controls"},{"text":"Primary and secondary controls"}],[{"text":"Cabin Systems"},{"text":"Environmental and passenger systems"}],[{"text":"Safety"},{"text":"Aviation safety and human factors"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The planner doesn't need to perform every maintenance task personally, but should understand the technical requirements, dependencies, duration, manpower, and resources involved."}]},{"heading":"Aircraft Maintenance Planning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand different maintenance categories:"},{"type":"h","text":"Line Maintenance"},{"type":"p","text":"Routine maintenance performed while aircraft operate through normal schedules."},{"type":"h","text":"Base Maintenance"},{"type":"p","text":"More extensive maintenance generally requiring hangar facilities and longer aircraft downtime."},{"type":"h","text":"Scheduled Maintenance"},{"type":"p","text":"Planned maintenance tasks based on approved maintenance programs."},{"type":"h","text":"Unscheduled Maintenance"},{"type":"p","text":"Maintenance resulting from defects, failures, operational findings, or unexpected conditions."},{"type":"h","text":"Heavy Maintenance"},{"type":"p","text":"Large maintenance events involving extensive inspections, structural work, system checks, or component replacement."}]},{"heading":"Maintenance Planning Concepts","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maintenance intervals"},{"text":"Flight hours"},{"text":"Flight cycles"},{"text":"Calendar limits"},{"text":"Due lists"},{"text":"Work packages"},{"text":"Task cards"},{"text":"Maintenance checks"},{"text":"Component life limits"},{"text":"Deferred defects"},{"text":"Aircraft downtime"},{"text":"Man-hour estimation"},{"text":"Maintenance capacity"},{"text":"Resource allocation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A planner should be able to answer:"},{"type":"p","text":"What needs to be done, when does it need to be done, how long will it take, and do we have the resources to complete it?"}]},{"heading":"Regulatory & Documentation Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop familiarity with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DGCA framework"},{"text":"Approved maintenance organizations"},{"text":"Maintenance organization procedures"},{"text":"Approved maintenance programs"},{"text":"Aircraft maintenance records"},{"text":"Airworthiness requirements"},{"text":"Continuing airworthiness concepts"},{"text":"Maintenance release documentation"},{"text":"Technical log systems"},{"text":"Safety management systems"},{"text":"Human factors"},{"text":"Quality and compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also understand the distinction between:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory requirements"},{"text":"Aircraft manufacturer requirements"},{"text":"Airline maintenance programs"},{"text":"Internal maintenance procedures"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For India-specific work, students should keep their knowledge aligned with the latest DGCA regulations and approved organizational procedures."}]},{"heading":"Important Aviation Documents","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to interpret the purpose and structure of documents such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft Maintenance Manual (AMM)"},{"text":"Illustrated Parts Catalogue (IPC)"},{"text":"Structural Repair Manual (SRM)"},{"text":"Component Maintenance Manual (CMM)"},{"text":"Wiring Diagram Manual (WDM)"},{"text":"Fault Isolation Manual (FIM)"},{"text":"Minimum Equipment List (MEL)"},{"text":"Configuration Deviation List (CDL)"},{"text":"Service Bulletins (SB)"},{"text":"Airworthiness Directives (AD)"},{"text":"Maintenance Planning Document (MPD)"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A planner doesn't simply read these documents—they use the information to determine maintenance requirements, resources, timing, and constraints."}]},{"heading":"MRO Planning Software & Tools","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Category","Tools / Technologies"],"rows":[[{"text":"MRO systems"},{"text":"AMOS, TRAX, Ramco Aviation"}],[{"text":"Enterprise systems"},{"text":"SAP"}],[{"text":"Planning"},{"text":"MS Project, Primavera"}],[{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Excel, Python"}],[{"text":"BI"},{"text":"Power BI"}],[{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"SQL"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"MS Office"}],[{"text":"Maintenance data"},{"text":"Aircraft/MRO-specific systems"}],[{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Python, pandas"}],[{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Power BI / Excel"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact MRO platform varies by airline or MRO organization."}]},{"heading":"Data Analytics Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Modern MRO planning increasingly depends on data."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pivot tables"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"Conditional logic"},{"text":"Dashboards"},{"text":"Forecasting"}]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"Aggregations"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"Window functions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful libraries:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"matplotlib"},{"text":"scikit-learn"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Python for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maintenance trend analysis"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Reliability analysis"},{"text":"Downtime analysis"},{"text":"Parts demand prediction"}]}]},{"heading":"Key MRO KPIs","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft availability"},{"text":"Aircraft utilization"},{"text":"Maintenance downtime"},{"text":"Schedule adherence"},{"text":"Maintenance man-hours"},{"text":"Turnaround time"},{"text":"On-time maintenance completion"},{"text":"Repeat defects"},{"text":"Component reliability"},{"text":"Parts availability"},{"text":"Deferred defects"},{"text":"Maintenance cost"},{"text":"Work-package completion"},{"text":"Fleet reliability"}]}]},{"heading":"Five Recommended Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Aircraft Maintenance Planning Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build an Excel/Power BI dashboard containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft registration"},{"text":"Aircraft type"},{"text":"Maintenance event"},{"text":"Due date"},{"text":"Flight hours"},{"text":"Flight cycles"},{"text":"Maintenance duration"},{"text":"Status"},{"text":"Assigned resources"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — MRO Work-Package Planner"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a planning application that generates a maintenance work package."},{"type":"flow","items":["Aircraft","Due Maintenance Tasks","Task Duration","Required Skills","Tools","Parts","Hangar Availability","Maintenance Schedule"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Aircraft Maintenance Forecasting"},{"type":"p","text":"Use historical data to forecast:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Upcoming maintenance events"},{"text":"Aircraft downtime"},{"text":"Component replacements"},{"text":"Manpower requirements"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["Python","pandas","forecasting techniques can be used."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — MRO Resource Optimization"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop an optimization model for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft"},{"text":"Engineers"},{"text":"Technicians"},{"text":"Hangars"},{"text":"Tools"},{"text":"Maintenance slots"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Objective:"},{"type":"p","text":"Minimize aircraft downtime while meeting maintenance requirements and resource constraints."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Predictive Maintenance Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated aircraft-component dataset and predict potential failures."},{"type":"flow","items":["Sensor / Maintenance Data","Data Cleaning","Feature Engineering","Reliability Analysis","ML Model","Failure Risk","Maintenance Recommendation"]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target internships with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airlines"},{"text":"Aircraft MRO organizations"},{"text":"Airport engineering organizations"},{"text":"Aviation engineering companies"},{"text":"Aircraft component MRO companies"},{"text":"Aviation software companies"},{"text":"Aircraft manufacturers"},{"text":"Maintenance planning departments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best departments to target"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maintenance Planning"},{"text":"Technical Services"},{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Continuing Airworthiness"},{"text":"Engineering"},{"text":"MRO Operations"},{"text":"Quality"},{"text":"Supply Chain"},{"text":"Maintenance Control"}]},{"type":"p","text":"An internship in maintenance planning or technical services is particularly valuable."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After graduation/training, possible roles include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MRO Planning Engineer"},{"text":"Maintenance Planning Engineer"},{"text":"Maintenance Planning Trainee"},{"text":"Technical Services Engineer"},{"text":"Aircraft Maintenance Planner"},{"text":"Reliability Engineer"},{"text":"Maintenance Control Engineer"},{"text":"MRO Operations Engineer"},{"text":"Fleet Technical Analyst"},{"text":"Maintenance Data Analyst"},{"text":"Aviation Planning Analyst"},{"text":"Component Planning Engineer"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer","Valuable Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Airlines"},{"text":"Fleet planning, maintenance programs, reliability"}],[{"text":"MRO Companies"},{"text":"Work packages, hangar planning, resource management"}],[{"text":"Aircraft OEMs"},{"text":"Technical documentation, engineering analysis"}],[{"text":"Component MRO"},{"text":"Component planning, inventory, repair cycles"}],[{"text":"Aviation Software"},{"text":"MRO systems, SQL, analytics"}],[{"text":"Airport Organizations"},{"text":"Maintenance coordination, engineering"}],[{"text":"Aviation Consultants"},{"text":"MRO optimization, analytics, process improvement"}]]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aviation safety"},{"text":"Aircraft maintenance fundamentals"},{"text":"MRO management"},{"text":"Reliability engineering"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Lean / Six Sigma"},{"text":"Aviation quality management"},{"text":"Excel & Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python for analytics"},{"text":"Aviation human factors"},{"text":"Safety Management Systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For regulated aviation roles, formal DGCA-approved training/licensing requirements take priority over generic certificates."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Technical pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech / AME-related Training","MRO Planning Engineer","M.Tech / Specialized PG","Advanced MRO / Reliability / Aviation Engineering"]},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aerospace Engineering"},{"text":"Aeronautical Engineering"},{"text":"Aviation Management"},{"text":"Aircraft Maintenance Management"},{"text":"Reliability Engineering"},{"text":"Industrial Engineering"},{"text":"Operations Research"},{"text":"Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"Data Analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"An MBA in Aviation Management / Operations / Supply Chain can also be useful for management progression."}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After gaining experience, the engineer can specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Maintenance Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maintenance schedules"},{"text":"Work packages"},{"text":"Fleet planning"},{"text":"Aircraft availability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Reliability Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Failure trends"},{"text":"Component reliability"},{"text":"Repeat defects"},{"text":"Reliability programs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. MRO Optimization"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Resource optimization"},{"text":"Cost reduction"},{"text":"Turnaround-time improvement"},{"text":"Capacity planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Maintenance Program Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Maintenance intervals"},{"text":"Task analysis"},{"text":"Program optimization"},{"text":"Fleet technical data"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. MRO Data Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Combine aviation with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Predictive maintenance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Continuing Airworthiness"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on maintaining aircraft airworthiness throughout their operational life, subject to the applicable regulatory and organizational framework."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Planning Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["MRO Planning Trainee","MRO Planning Engineer","Senior Planning Engineer","Maintenance Planning Lead","MRO Planning Manager","Head of Maintenance Planning","Director / Head of MRO"]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["MRO Planning Engineer","Technical Services Engineer","Reliability Engineer","Senior Reliability Engineer","Fleet Engineering Manager","Technical Services / Engineering Head"]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["MRO Planning Engineer","Maintenance Data Analyst","MRO Analytics Engineer","Predictive Maintenance Specialist","MRO Digital Transformation Lead"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI-Based Predictive Maintenance"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can predict:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Component failures"},{"text":"Maintenance requirements"},{"text":"Aircraft downtime"},{"text":"Parts demand"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Twins"},{"type":"p","text":"Aircraft and maintenance processes can be represented digitally to simulate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Component health"},{"text":"Maintenance schedules"},{"text":"Fleet utilization"},{"text":"Maintenance scenarios"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI Scheduling"},{"type":"p","text":"Future MRO systems can optimize:"},{"type":"p","text":"Aircraft"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Maintenance Tasks"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Technicians"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Tools"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Parts"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Hangar Slots"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aircraft Schedule","AI-Optimized Maintenance Plan"]},{"type":"h","text":"Computer Vision"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aircraft inspection"},{"text":"Surface damage detection"},{"text":"Corrosion identification"},{"text":"Structural inspection assistance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Connected Aircraft"},{"type":"p","text":"Aircraft data can increasingly feed maintenance analytics systems for condition-based and predictive maintenance."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Aircraft Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Aircraft Maintenance"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"MRO Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Maintenance Programs"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Aviation Regulations"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Technical Documentation"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Reliability Engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Scheduling & Resource Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Excel + Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"SQL + Python"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"MRO Software"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Aviation Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Industry Internship"}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Understand major aircraft systems."},{"text":"Understand scheduled and unscheduled maintenance."},{"text":"Read and interpret basic aviation technical documentation."},{"text":"Understand aircraft maintenance programs."},{"text":"Prepare maintenance schedules."},{"text":"Build aircraft maintenance work packages."},{"text":"Estimate manpower and maintenance duration."},{"text":"Understand parts and tooling requirements."},{"text":"Track aircraft maintenance status."},{"text":"Analyze fleet maintenance data."},{"text":"Build MRO dashboards."},{"text":"Understand reliability metrics."},{"text":"Use Excel at an advanced level."},{"text":"Use Power BI for maintenance reporting."},{"text":"Have basic SQL and Python analytics skills."},{"text":"Understand aviation safety and regulatory concepts."},{"text":"Complete at least 2–3 MRO-related projects."},{"text":"Gain relevant aviation/MRO internship exposure."}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest 2026+ profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aircraft Maintenance Knowledge","MRO Planning","Reliability Engineering","Aviation Compliance","Data Analytics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The major differentiator will be combining traditional aircraft maintenance knowledge with digital MRO capabilities."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech / AME Pathway","Aircraft Maintenance & Systems Knowledge","MRO Internship","MRO Planning Engineer","Reliability / Maintenance Program Experience","Senior MRO Planning Engineer","MRO Planning Manager","Head of MRO / Maintenance Planning"]},{"type":"flow","items":["MRO Planning","Reliability","Aviation Regulations","Excel/Power BI","SQL/Python","MRO Software."],"sep":"+","label":"Best-fit skill combination"}]}]}